{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_06_end","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_06","title":"紧追猛赶","storyCode":"DH-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"90cb0f43e93de694bc14f359fd943991475e7198bb5efed182e0a6202257ba7a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陈林二人突破其他队伍的包围来到海边，眼看已经赶不上，林雨霞使出独门绝技，成功出线。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是鼠胆龙威队的两位女侠，如果是战斗的话，她们就绝不会让人失望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"她们轻松地解决了围住她们的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，此时第一梯队已经游过了一半距离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠胆龙威队，赶得上吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什么？该游泳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我们认为埃内斯托有问题，而他又在我们后面，其实我们应该以他为优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一定道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们依然不能确定他就有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，无论这背后是谁，很明显，对方都不希望我们赢得比赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但赢得比赛这个目的太宽泛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，对方不希望我们上船，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了，要输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"输？不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先去吧，好久没做类似的事了，我要做一些准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"经过短暂的讨论后，不知为何，两位女侠中，陈女侠先行下水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而林女侠则留在沙滩上，一边热身，一边似乎在从沙滩上收集沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经知道，林女侠的能力是将沙子变成玻璃作为武器，难道说，她要用沙子在海面上造出一座玻璃大桥？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是爸爸的话，肯定能用这里的沙子直接变出一座桥来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我可做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我也有我的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多沙子应该足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁的位置......正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"林女侠居然真的在海面上“走”了起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她并不是走，而是在跳跃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她的每一个落脚点，都有她用沙子生成的玻璃作为支撑，供她进行下一次的跳跃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，她为了省沙子，如果就近有其他人，她就直接踩在那个人身上，用那个人的身体作为跳板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，有意思，太有意思了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。这真是前所未有的渡海方式！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，两人是商量好，因为近海缺少跳板，所以由陈女侠来充当她的第一块跳板，为林女侠的前进铺平道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"两人再一次向我们展现了她们令人感动的队友情谊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，林小姐这法子确实出乎意料，但我觉得吧，她们一定没有商量好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，镜头里一闪而过的老陈那张臭脸太有趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，没想到这两个人合作起来这么好玩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"保持第一的依然是甜蜜夏日队，嘉文选手以势不可挡的劲头向着终点进发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"其他队伍也紧跟其后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他们都没有想到，在他们的身后，还有一个林女侠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"她直接越过了第三名！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"第二名的头也只能成为她的跳板！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉文注意到她了，但是那又能怎么样呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉文，嘉文也被林女侠无情地越过头顶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，第一名是林小姐，第一名，依然是鼠胆龙威队！！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这真是一场让人热血沸腾的逆转！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，不是吧，这都能赢，真的假的，这未免也太犯规了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下，该怎么办好呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
